{%- comment -%}
  Zevaraz — asset loader
  Rendered at the top of every zev-* section so the token layer and the exact
  font weights are present without editing layout/theme.liquid. Repeated tags
  are deduplicated by the browser; this costs nothing after the first section.

  If you prefer it in one place, move these three lines into theme.liquid
  before </head> and delete the render calls.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
{{ 'zev-tokens.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
